ser_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/七、汝宁府（卷五十）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"宋南渡以后，陈亮议以信阳为恢复之资，卒之师入蔡州，由先克...","context_before":"...乱，义阳遂入于东魏。陈氏力争淮西，而义阳不复，卒至丧败。","source_end_index":656,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"991a3e36-0237-5346-ac12-61f7f907fe04","source_start_index":636,"source_text":"唐之中叶，淮西拒命，恒以申州当沔北诸军。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/七、汝宁府（卷五十）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"29丁亥，以太子少保崔光遠爲荊、襄招討使，充山南東道處置兵馬都使；以陳、潁、亳、申節度使王仲昇爲申、沔等五州節度使，知淮南西道行營兵馬。","content_fanyi":"九月二十四日丁亥，太子少保崔光远被任命为荆州、襄州招讨使，并充任山南东道处置兵马都使；陈州、颍州、亳州、申州节度使王仲升被任命为申州、沔州等五州节度使，掌管淮南西道行营兵马。","content_jianti_auto":"29丁亥，以太子少保崔光远为荆、襄招讨使，充山南东道处置兵马都使；以陈、颍、亳、申节度使王仲升为申、沔等五州节度使，知淮南西道行营兵马。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":22304,"number":29,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百二十一 (唐紀三十七) / 肅宗文明武德大聖大宣孝皇帝下之上 / 乾元二年 / 第 38 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"bec46f64-db0e-11ef-9b85-a0d3651f611f","year_int":759},"tongjian_id":"bec46f64-db0e-11ef-9b85-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"申","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"使，疏吏翻。少，始照翻。故爲，于僞翻；下因爲同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"使，疏吏翻。少，始照翻。故为，于伪翻；下因为同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"c104a617-db0e-11ef-817e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"申","place_name_jianti_auto":"申","resolved_place_entity_id":887,"start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"c104a620-db0e-11ef-b2a7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"7秋，七月，淮西兵馬使吳少誠殺陳仙奇，自爲留後。少誠素狡險，爲李希烈所寵任，故爲之報仇。己酉，以虔王諒爲申、光、隨、蔡節度大使，以少誠爲留後。","content_fanyi":"秋季，七月，淮西兵马使吴少诚杀死淮西节度使陈仙奇，自己担任留后。吴少诚一向狡诈阴险，受到李希烈宠信、重用，因此杀死陈仙奇为李希烈报仇。七月二十二日己酉，德宗任命虔王李谅担任申州、光州、随州、蔡州节度大使，任命吴少诚为留后。","content_jianti_auto":"7秋，七月，淮西兵马使吴少诚杀陈仙奇，自为留后。少诚素狡险，为李希烈所宠任，故为之报仇。己酉，以虔王谅为申、光、随、蔡节度大使，以少诚为留后。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"，恶相师，机相伺，逆相报，所固然也。杀机之动，天下相杀于...","context_before":"...怀光死于牛名俊，李希烈死于陈仙奇，而李怀仙旋死于朱希彩，","source_end_index":82,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"5e408ad8-3416-4393-b6a0-61ea8bcb65fe","source_start_index":73,"source_text":"陈仙奇旋死于吴少诚"}],"title":"二五 杀主而降不可赦"},{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"，淮西数十年不戢之焚，皆自此启之矣。","context_before":"...鬼诛，则亦恶用天子为也？俟人祸之加，则陈仙奇因以反戈，而","source_end_index":337,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"b47485ec-a71f-4eba-8f0a-9b303c98b606","source_start_index":332,"source_text":"吴少诚踵之"}],"title":"二六 李怀光既诛陆敬舆不肯乘胜讨淮西"}],"id":23383,"number":7,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百三十二 (唐紀四十八) / 德宗神武聖文皇帝七 / 二年 / 第 9 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"c104a616-db0e-11ef-bec0-a0d3651f611f","year_int":786},"tongjian_id":"c104a616-db0e-11ef-bec0-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":2},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"申","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"吳少誠","people_name_jianti_auto":"吴少诚","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"c261afeb-db0e-11ef-bf09-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"淮西","place_name_jianti_auto":"淮西","place_note":"总部设蔡州【河南汝南县】","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"c261afec-db0e-11ef-9957-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"申","place_name_jianti_auto":"申","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"c261afed-db0e-11ef-95fc-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"光","place_name_jianti_auto":"光","place_note":"河南潢川县","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"c261afee-db0e-11ef-aee3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蔡","place_name_jianti_auto":"蔡","place_note":"河南汝南县","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"c261afef-db0e-11ef-992a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"吳少誠時據淮西，有申、光、蔡三州。","note_content_jianti_auto":"吴少诚时据淮西，有申、光、蔡三州。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"c261afea-db0e-11ef-a058-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"申","place_name_jianti_auto":"申","place_note":"河南信阳市","resolved_place_entity_id":887,"start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"c261aff0-db0e-11ef-ac55-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"1春，二月，乙亥，名申、光、蔡軍曰彰義。","content_fanyi":"春季，二月二十四日乙亥，朝廷将申、光、蔡军命名为彰义军。","content_jianti_auto":"1春，二月，乙亥，名申、光、蔡军曰彰义。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":23689,"number":1,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百三十五 (唐紀五十一) / 德宗神武聖文皇帝十 / 十四年 / 第 1 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"c261afe9-db0e-11ef-ba2d-a0d3651f611f","year_int":798},"tongjian_id":"c261afe9-db0e-11ef-ba2d-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":3},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"申","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"考異曰：實錄作「談峻」。今從舊傳。","note_content_jianti_auto":"考异曰：实录作「谈峻」。今从旧传。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":63,"tongjian_id":"c3048304-db0e-11ef-91a1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"申","place_name_jianti_auto":"申","resolved_place_entity_id":887,"start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"c304830c-db0e-11ef-a258-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/七、汝宁府（卷五十）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"说者谓：自希烈据蔡，以迄于元济，蔡州不被王化者，几四十年...","context_before":"...抗命，李希烈纵横搏噬，河、洛、淮、汉之交，诸州悉被其患。","source_end_index":288,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"cf0da9ee-1990-5899-8fbc-8bf8f65edd75","source_start_index":258,"source_text":"其后吴元济以申、光、蔡三州，拒天下之兵，四面攻围，四年乃克。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/七、汝宁府（卷五十）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"11壬戌，以忠武節度副使李光顏爲節度使。甲子，以嚴綬爲申、光、蔡招撫使，督諸道兵招討吳元濟；乙丑，命內常侍知省事崔潭峻監其軍。戊辰，以尚書左丞呂元膺爲東都留守。","content_fanyi":"十月十九日壬戌，宪宗把忠武节度副使李光颜提升为节度使。十月二十一日甲子，严绶被宪宗任命为申、光、蔡三州招抚使，并受命督领各道兵马招讨吴元济；十月二十二日乙丑，宪宗又派负责内侍省事务的内常侍崔潭峻前往严绶军中担任监军。十月二十五日戊辰，尚书左丞吕元膺被宪宗任命为东都留守。","content_jianti_auto":"11壬戌，以忠武节度副使李光颜为节度使。甲子，以严绶为申、光、蔡招抚使，督诸道兵招讨吴元济；乙丑，命内常侍知省事崔潭峻监其军。戊辰，以尚书左丞吕元膺为东都留守。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":24143,"number":11,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百三十九 (唐紀五十五) / 憲宗昭文章武大聖至神孝皇帝中之上 / 九年 / 第 16 段","reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"c3048302-db0e-11ef-a940-a0d3651f611f","year_int":814},"tongjian_id":"c3048302-db0e-11ef-a940-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":4},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"申","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"李遜","people_name_jianti_auto":"李逊","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"c3148a0c-db0e-11ef-a5e8-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"霞寓","people_name_jianti_auto":"霞寓","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"c3148a0d-db0e-11ef-b2fb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"李遜主餉，霞寓軍因得以罪歸之。","note_content_jianti_auto":"李逊主饷，霞寓军因得以罪归之。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"c3148a0b-db0e-11ef-a85d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"c3148a10-db0e-11ef-8d48-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"c3148a11-db0e-11ef-a914-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"張","people_name_jianti_auto":"张","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"c3148a12-db0e-11ef-b413-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：甲十一行本「月」下有「丁丑」二字；乙十一行本同；孔本同；張校同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：甲十一行本「月」下有「丁丑」二字；乙十一行本同；孔本同；张校同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"c3148a0f-db0e-11ef-a1c1-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"c3148a0e-db0e-11ef-9642-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"歸州","place_name_jianti_auto":"归州","place_note":"湖北省秭归县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"c3148a14-db0e-11ef-b5ae-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秭歸","place_name_jianti_auto":"秭归","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"c3148a15-db0e-11ef-84f9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"吳","place_name_jianti_auto":"吴","place_note":"江苏苏州","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"c3148a16-db0e-11ef-b742-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"建平郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"建平郡","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"c3148a17-db0e-11ef-a533-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"c3148a18-db0e-11ef-92e2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"歸州","place_name_jianti_auto":"归州","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"c3148a19-db0e-11ef-bfaf-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"京師","place_name_jianti_auto":"京师","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"c3148a1a-db0e-11ef-86b0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"歸州，古之秭歸，吳立建平郡，唐置歸州，京師南二千二百六十八里。","note_content_jianti_auto":"归州，古之秭归，吴立建平郡，唐置归州，京师南二千二百六十八里。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"c3148a13-db0e-11ef-abb0-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"恩王","people_name_jianti_auto":"恩王","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"c3148a1c-db0e-11ef-8acb-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"連","people_name_jianti_auto":"连","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"c3148a1d-db0e-11ef-b793-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"代宗","people_name_jianti_auto":"代宗","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"c3148a1e-db0e-11ef-a2e7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"恩王連，代宗之子。","note_content_jianti_auto":"恩王连，代宗之子。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"c3148a1b-db0e-11ef-8359-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"申","place_name_jianti_auto":"申","resolved_place_entity_id":887,"start_index":69,"tongjian_id":"c3148a2c-db0e-11ef-9a7f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"上責高霞寓之敗，霞寓稱李遜應接不至。秋，七月，貶霞寓爲歸州刺史，遜亦左遷恩王傅。以河南尹鄭權爲山南東道節度使。以荊南節度使袁滋爲彰義節度、申·光·蔡·唐·隨·鄧觀察使，以唐州爲理所。","content_fanyi":"皇上追究高霞寓战败的责任，高霞寓声称李逊没有前来接应。秋季七月，高霞寓被贬为归州刺史，李逊也降职为恩王傅。朝廷任命河南尹郑权为山南东道节度使，又任命荆南节度使袁滋为彰义节度使，兼申、光、蔡、唐、随、邓观察使，以唐州为治所。","content_jianti_auto":"上责高霞寓之败，霞寓称李逊应接不至。秋，七月，贬霞寓为归州刺史，逊亦左迁恩王傅。以河南尹郑权为山南东道节度使。以荆南节度使袁滋为彰义节度、申·光·蔡·唐·随·邓观察使，以唐州为理所。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":24216,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百三十九 (唐紀五十五) / 憲宗昭文章武大聖至神孝皇帝中之上 / 十一年 / 第 22 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"c3148a0a-db0e-11ef-ac54-a0d3651f611f","year_int":816},"tongjian_id":"c3148a0a-db0e-11ef-ac54-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":5},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"申","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"愬","people_name_jianti_auto":"愬","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"c3300d51-db0e-11ef-befb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"愬軍聚射，矢集城上如蝟毛，言其多也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"愬军聚射，矢集城上如猬毛，言其多也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"c3300d50-db0e-11ef-a972-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"德宗","people_name_jianti_auto":"德宗","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"c33256b1-db0e-11ef-9e51-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"吳少誠","people_name_jianti_auto":"吴少诚","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"c33256b2-db0e-11ef-ba55-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"鄭澥","people_name_jianti_auto":"郑澥","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"c33256b3-db0e-11ef-8ea9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"裴度","people_name_jianti_auto":"裴度","start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"c33256b4-db0e-11ef-b439-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"李祐","people_name_jianti_auto":"李祐","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"c33256b5-db0e-11ef-a0ae-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"愬","people_name_jianti_auto":"愬","start_index":67,"tongjian_id":"c33256b6-db0e-11ef-b9db-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"田進誠","people_name_jianti_auto":"田进诚","start_index":75,"tongjian_id":"c33256b7-db0e-11ef-80e1-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"愬","people_name_jianti_auto":"愬","start_index":98,"tongjian_id":"c33256b8-db0e-11ef-8c1d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"李祐","people_name_jianti_auto":"李祐","start_index":104,"tongjian_id":"c33256b9-db0e-11ef-9616-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"愬","people_name_jianti_auto":"愬","start_index":126,"tongjian_id":"c33256ba-db0e-11ef-8bf8-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"鄭澥","people_name_jianti_auto":"郑澥","start_index":142,"tongjian_id":"c33256bb-db0e-11ef-ba76-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"裴度","people_name_jianti_auto":"裴度","start_index":148,"tongjian_id":"c33256bc-db0e-11ef-a3fa-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"愬","people_name_jianti_auto":"愬","start_index":206,"tongjian_id":"c33256bd-db0e-11ef-84ca-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"李愬","people_name_jianti_auto":"李愬","start_index":225,"tongjian_id":"c33256be-db0e-11ef-877c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"元濟","people_name_jianti_auto":"元济","start_index":234,"tongjian_id":"c33256bf-db0e-11ef-b834-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"韓愈","people_name_jianti_auto":"韩愈","start_index":248,"tongjian_id":"c33256c0-db0e-11ef-b6ee-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"愬","people_name_jianti_auto":"愬","start_index":260,"tongjian_id":"c33256c1-db0e-11ef-ac99-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"元濟","people_name_jianti_auto":"元济","start_index":305,"tongjian_id":"c33256c2-db0e-11ef-bae8-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"元濟","people_name_jianti_auto":"元济","start_index":323,"tongjian_id":"c33256c3-db0e-11ef-b670-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"蔡州","place_name_jianti_auto":"蔡州","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"c33256c4-db0e-11ef-856c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蔡州","place_name_jianti_auto":"蔡州","start_index":115,"tongjian_id":"c33256c5-db0e-11ef-a248-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蔡州","place_name_jianti_auto":"蔡州","start_index":132,"tongjian_id":"c33256c6-db0e-11ef-83b0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"懸瓠城","place_name_jianti_auto":"悬瓠城","start_index":229,"tongjian_id":"c33256c7-db0e-11ef-a706-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"文城","place_name_jianti_auto":"文城","start_index":268,"tongjian_id":"c33256c8-db0e-11ef-8a2a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蔡","place_name_jianti_auto":"蔡","start_index":298,"tongjian_id":"c33256c9-db0e-11ef-8c2a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"德宗貞元二年，吳少誠得蔡州，三世，三十二年而滅。考異曰：舊·愬傳曰：「其月七日，使判官鄭澥告期於裴度。十日夜，以李祐率突將三千爲先鋒，愬自率中軍三千，田進誠以後軍三千殿而行。」元濟傳曰：「十一月，愬夜出軍，令李祐爲前鋒，其十日夜至蔡州城下。」實錄曰：「愬以十月將襲蔡州，先七日，使判官鄭澥告師期於裴度。」按先七日，卽是平蔡錄所云「八日甲子」也；而愬傳誤云「七日」。而又云「十日夜帥軍行」，亦誤。元濟傳：「十一月，愬出軍，」尤誤。裴度傳：「十月十一日，李愬襲破懸瓠城，擒元濟，」亦誤。按十月戊午朔，韓愈平淮西碑云：「壬申，愬用所得賊將，自文城，因天大雪，疾馳百二十里。」卽十五日也。又曰：「用夜半到蔡，破其門，取元濟以獻。」卽十六日也。實錄「己卯執元濟」，乃奏到日也。今從平蔡錄。","note_content_jianti_auto":"德宗贞元二年，吴少诚得蔡州，三世，三十二年而灭。考异曰：旧·愬传曰：「其月七日，使判官郑澥告期于裴度。十日夜，以李祐率突将三千为先锋，愬自率中军三千，田进诚以后军三千殿而行。」元济传曰：「十一月，愬夜出军，令李祐为前锋，其十日夜至蔡州城下。」实录曰：「愬以十月将袭蔡州，先七日，使判官郑澥告师期于裴度。」按先七日，即是平蔡录所云「八日甲子」也；而愬传误云「七日」。而又云「十日夜帅军行」，亦误。元济传：「十一月，愬出军，」尤误。裴度传：「十月十一日，李愬袭破悬瓠城，擒元济，」亦误。按十月戊午朔，韩愈平淮西碑云：「壬申，愬用所得贼将，自文城，因天大雪，疾驰百二十里。」即十五日也。又曰：「用夜半到蔡，破其门，取元济以献。」即十六日也。实录「己卯执元济」，乃奏到日也。今从平蔡录。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":84,"tongjian_id":"c3300d52-db0e-11ef-b15d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"申","place_name_jianti_auto":"申","place_note":"河南省信阳市","resolved_place_entity_id":1579,"start_index":93,"tongjian_id":"c33256dd-db0e-11ef-b78b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"容斋随笔/韩文公佚事","excerpts":[{"context_after":"。三军之士为公恨。复谓度曰：‘今藉声势，王承宗可以辞取，...","context_before":"...讨元济，请于裴度，须精兵千人，间道以入，必擒贼。未及行，","source_end_index":370,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"4eed07cf-0bcb-456a-a1ff-29ca19384011","source_start_index":359,"source_text":"李愬自文城夜入，得元济"}],"path":"随笔/卷八/韩文公佚事","source_name":"容斋随笔"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"愬遣李進誠攻牙城，毀其外門，得甲庫，取器械。癸酉，復攻之，燒其南門，民爭負薪芻助之，城上矢如蝟毛。晡時，門壞，元濟於城上請罪，進誠梯而下之。甲戌，愬以檻車送元濟詣京師，且告于裴度。是日，申、光二州及諸鎭兵二萬餘人相繼來降。","content_fanyi":"李愬派李进诚进攻吴元济的牙城，毁坏牙城的外门，夺得武器库，取出兵器。十月十七日癸酉，李愬的军队再次进攻牙城，烧毁其南门，百姓争着背来柴草协助官军，官军射到城上的箭密如刺猬毛。傍晚时分，城门被攻破，吴元济在城上请求治罪，李进诚用梯子将他接下来。十月十八日甲戌，李愬用囚车将吴元济押送京城长安，并向裴度报告。当天，申、光二州以及各镇援助淮西的军队共两万余人相继向官军投降。","content_jianti_auto":"愬遣李进诚攻牙城，毁其外门，得甲库，取器械。癸酉，复攻之，烧其南门，民争负薪刍助之，城上矢如猬毛。晡时，门坏，元济于城上请罪，进诚梯而下之。甲戌，愬以槛车送元济诣京师，且告于裴度。是日，申、光二州及诸镇兵二万余人相继来降。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"如鸡鹜，其易也如此，而环攻四年，其难也如彼，唐安得有将相...","context_before":"...于三寇之苞苴，而为之唇舌者也。故蔡州一空城，元济一独夫，","source_end_index":227,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"599f4328-f637-4a1f-a9c6-e11f111f58a4","source_start_index":220,"source_text":"李愬一夕而缚之"},{"context_after":"，其易也如此，而环攻四年，其难也如彼，唐安得有将相哉？皆...","context_before":"...于三寇之苞苴，而为之唇舌者也。故蔡州一空城，元济一独夫，","source_end_index":230,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"599f4328-f637-4a1f-a9c6-e11f111f58a4","source_start_index":220,"source_text":"李愬一夕而缚之如鸡鹜"}],"title":"一四 唐乏将相"}],"id":24283,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百四十 (唐紀五十六) / 憲宗昭文章武大聖至神孝皇帝中之下 / 元和十二年 / 第 45 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"c3300d4f-db0e-11ef-935f-a0d3651f611f","year_int":817},"tongjian_id":"c3300d4f-db0e-11ef-935f-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":6},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"申","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"昭","people_name_jianti_auto":"昭","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"c3576749-db0e-11ef-9c79-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"見昭十一年。般，音班。","note_content_jianti_auto":"见昭十一年。般，音班。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"c3576748-db0e-11ef-8a61-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"申","place_name_jianti_auto":"申","resolved_place_entity_id":1579,"start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"c3576750-db0e-11ef-be02-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"臣光曰：春秋書楚子虔誘蔡侯般殺之于申。彼列國也，孔子猶深貶之，惡其誘討也，況爲天子而誘匹夫乎！","content_fanyi":"臣司马光评论说：《春秋》记载，楚子虔把蔡侯般诱到申地后杀了他。那是诸侯国之间的事，孔子尚且深深贬斥，因为厌恶这种用引诱欺骗手段讨伐的做法，何况身为天子却去诱骗平民呢！","content_jianti_auto":"臣光曰：春秋书楚子虔诱蔡侯般杀之于申。彼列国也，孔子犹深贬之，恶其诱讨也，况为天子而诱匹夫乎！","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":24395,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百四十一 (唐紀五十七) / 憲宗昭文章武大聖至神孝皇帝下 / 元和十四年 / 第 41 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"c3576747-db0e-11ef-9069-a0d3651f611f","year_int":819},"tongjian_id":"c3576747-db0e-11ef-9069-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":7},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"申","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"周世宗","people_name_jianti_auto":"周世宗","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"c5767579-db0e-11ef-b0aa-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"通州","place_name_jianti_auto":"通州","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"c576757a-db0e-11ef-b03d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"山南東道","place_name_jianti_auto":"山南东道","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"c576757b-db0e-11ef-b366-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"宋","place_name_jianti_auto":"宋","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"c576757c-db0e-11ef-a149-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"達州","place_name_jianti_auto":"达州","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"c576757d-db0e-11ef-b1aa-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"南唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"南唐","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"c576757e-db0e-11ef-8669-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"靜海軍","place_name_jianti_auto":"静海军","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"c576757f-db0e-11ef-a1dd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"通州","place_name_jianti_auto":"通州","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"c5767580-db0e-11ef-823f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"淮東","place_name_jianti_auto":"淮东","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"c5767581-db0e-11ef-86f3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"通州","place_name_jianti_auto":"通州","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"c5767582-db0e-11ef-a006-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"c5767583-db0e-11ef-ba3b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"揚州","place_name_jianti_auto":"扬州","start_index":51,"tongjian_id":"c5767584-db0e-11ef-9a60-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"海陵縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"海陵县","start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"c5767585-db0e-11ef-ac5a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":60,"tongjian_id":"c5767586-db0e-11ef-89e4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"淮南道","place_name_jianti_auto":"淮南道","start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"c5767587-db0e-11ef-9f96-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"通州","place_name_jianti_auto":"通州","start_index":67,"tongjian_id":"c5767588-db0e-11ef-8e2d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"按唐書·地理志，通州屬山南東道，宋之達州是也。周世宗以南唐靜海軍置通州，今淮東之通州是也，其地在唐則爲揚州海陵縣之東境。唐時淮南道未有通州，此必誤。參考下文，「通」當作「蘄」。","note_content_jianti_auto":"按唐书·地理志，通州属山南东道，宋之达州是也。周世宗以南唐静海军置通州，今淮东之通州是也，其地在唐则为扬州海陵县之东境。唐时淮南道未有通州，此必误。参考下文，「通」当作「蕲」。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"c5767578-db0e-11ef-8843-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"申","place_name_jianti_auto":"申","place_note":"河南信阳市","resolved_place_entity_id":1579,"start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"c576758b-db0e-11ef-b4ae-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十、安庆府（卷二十六）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"中和四年，舒州陷于群贼吴迥等，庐州刺史杨行密遣兵击定之。...","context_before":"...史张万福摄舒州事，讨平之。咸通九年，徐州贼庞勋遣兵来寇。","source_end_index":521,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"dce9f7fe-f5e4-5867-9fe1-21344bc360d0","source_start_index":508,"source_text":"乾符三年，贼王仙芝陷舒州。"}],"path":"南直方舆纪要/十、安庆府（卷二十六）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"23十二月，王仙芝攻申、光、廬、壽、舒、通等州。淮南節度使劉鄴奏求益兵，敕感化節度使薛能選精兵數千助之。","content_fanyi":"十二月，王仙芝进攻申、光、庐、寿、舒、通等州。淮南节度使刘邺奏请增兵，朝廷敕令感化节度使薛能挑选数千名精兵前往援助。","content_jianti_auto":"23十二月，王仙芝攻申、光、庐、寿、舒、通等州。淮南节度使刘邺奏求益兵，敕感化节度使薛能选精兵数千助之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":25868,"number":23,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百五十二 (唐紀六十八) / 僖宗惠聖恭定孝皇帝上之上 / 三年 / 第 24 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"c5767577-db0e-11ef-88f9-a0d3651f611f","year_int":876},"tongjian_id":"c5767577-db0e-11ef-88f9-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":8},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"申","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"約還者，戒約將士，使還赴援也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"约还者，戒约将士，使还赴援也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":124,"tongjian_id":"c58d7659-db0e-11ef-b45e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"申","place_name_jianti_auto":"申","place_note":"河南省信阳市","resolved_place_entity_id":1579,"start_index":93,"tongjian_id":"c58d766a-db0e-11ef-96f7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"18乙卯，王仙芝陷隨州，執刺史崔休徵。山南東道節度使李福遣其子將兵救隨州，戰死。福奏求援兵，遣左武衞大將軍李昌言將鳳翔五百騎赴之，仙芝遂轉掠復、郢。忠武大將張貫等四千人與宣武兵援襄州，自申、蔡間道逃歸；詔忠武節度使崔安潛、宣武節度使穆仁裕遣人約還。","content_fanyi":"九月十七日乙卯，王仙芝攻下随州，将刺史崔休征擒获。山南东道节度使李福派他的儿子领兵前去救援随州，其子战死。李福上表请求增援，朝廷派遣左武卫大将军李昌言率领凤翔的五百名骑兵赶往救援，王仙芝便转而攻掠复州、郢州一带。忠武军大将张贯等四千人与宣武镇的军队一同援救襄州，他们却从申州、蔡州间的小路逃回本州；朝廷下诏，令忠武节度使崔安潜、宣武节度使穆仁裕派人将将士们召回约束，仍让他们回救襄州。","content_jianti_auto":"18乙卯，王仙芝陷随州，执刺史崔休征。山南东道节度使李福遣其子将兵救随州，战死。福奏求援兵，遣左武衞大将军李昌言将凤翔五百骑赴之，仙芝遂转掠复、郢。忠武大将张贯等四千人与宣武兵援襄州，自申、蔡间道逃归；诏忠武节度使崔安潜、宣武节度使穆仁裕遣人约还。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":25893,"number":18,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百五十三 (唐紀六十九) / 僖宗惠聖恭定孝皇帝上之下 / 乾符四年 / 第 19 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"c58d7657-db0e-11ef-8b98-a0d3651f611f","year_int":877},"tongjian_id":"c58d7657-db0e-11ef-8b98-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":9},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"申","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"申","place_name_jianti_auto":"申","place_note":"河南省信阳市","resolved_place_entity_id":1579,"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"c5bfe390-db0e-11ef-875a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"27劉漢宏南掠申、光。","content_fanyi":"刘汉宏南下劫掠申州、光州。","content_jianti_auto":"27刘汉宏南掠申、光。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":25995,"number":27,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百五十三 (唐紀六十九) / 僖宗惠聖恭定孝皇帝上之下 / 廣明元年 / 第 28 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"c5bfe38e-db0e-11ef-841b-a0d3651f611f","year_int":880},"tongjian_id":"c5bfe38e-db0e-11ef-841b-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":10}],"page_size":10,"total_pages":2,"total_paragraphs":12},"place_name":"申"},"message":"success","success":true}